WEBVTT

00:26.930 --> 00:30.170
All right. Got a new sword in the process.

00:32.610 --> 00:35.660
If the demon commanders 
were the gatekeepers...

00:35.660 --> 00:38.860
Yeah. The lord of the forest is ahead.

00:44.610 --> 00:45.690
We're going in.

00:45.690 --> 00:46.710
Got it.

00:55.280 --> 01:00.870
The Faraway Paladin

00:57.110 --> 01:00.870
<b><u>The Lord of the Rust Mountains</u></b>

02:20.530 --> 02:26.500
The Mad Forest

02:26.760 --> 02:28.440
That big tree is...

02:28.440 --> 02:33.100
Yeah. The Lord of Holly that rules 
over this forest's winters.

02:43.010 --> 02:44.900
Words of Creation?

02:44.900 --> 02:48.120
That's... a curse.

02:48.120 --> 02:49.690
They're blasphemous words.

02:49.960 --> 02:52.810
What has happened to my gatekeepers?

02:52.810 --> 02:54.550
What do you think?

02:54.940 --> 02:57.190
I see, I see.

02:57.190 --> 03:02.010
I presume, then, that you are the 
Faraway Paladin, Sir William,

03:02.010 --> 03:05.460
and you are the one called 
Meneldor of Swift Wings.

03:07.290 --> 03:08.460
General...

03:08.760 --> 03:10.210
Cernunnos.

03:10.210 --> 03:13.070
If the two celebrated heroes have come here,

03:13.070 --> 03:15.080
we need not waste time.

03:18.840 --> 03:22.450
I will see that you die right here.

03:24.330 --> 03:26.550
<i>A few days ago, on the summer solstice...</i>

03:27.540 --> 03:31.420
<i>I saw snowdrops blooming out of season,</i>

03:31.420 --> 03:33.020
<i>and that's where it started.</i>

03:34.310 --> 03:39.010
<i>Crown Prince Ethel of Whitesails asked 
me to find out why it was happening,</i>

03:39.010 --> 03:42.380
<i>so we came here, where we found...</i>

03:49.370 --> 03:51.230
What in the world...

03:51.230 --> 03:52.300
The forest...

03:53.570 --> 03:55.810
The forest has gone mad.

03:58.940 --> 04:03.360
This entire forest region is 
ruled by two ancient trees,

04:03.360 --> 04:05.910
the Lord of Oak and the Lord of Holly.

04:05.910 --> 04:07.160
Ancient trees?

04:07.160 --> 04:08.840
They're twin brothers.

04:09.240 --> 04:12.810
The Lord of Oak rules from the winter 
solstice to the summer solstice.

04:12.810 --> 04:16.530
The lord brothers yield the royal authority 
to one another at each solstice,

04:16.530 --> 04:18.850
keeping the four seasons turning 
throughout the forest.

04:19.580 --> 04:20.850
Then...

04:20.850 --> 04:25.660
The transfer of the royal authority 
may have stagnated for some reason.

04:26.200 --> 04:28.860
If it's been thrown off right 
on the summer solstice...

04:29.340 --> 04:30.880
It must be the Lord of Oak.

04:33.960 --> 04:37.250
Great Lord of Oak, ruler of the forest,

04:37.860 --> 04:40.710
why do you refuse to transfer the 
royal authority to the Lord of Holly?

04:41.000 --> 04:43.700
Nay, children of man.

04:43.700 --> 04:48.960
It is the Lord of Holly who will 
not accept the transfer of power.

04:50.270 --> 04:51.350
Why not?

04:51.830 --> 04:53.380
I do not know.

04:53.380 --> 04:56.000
My communication with the 
Lord of Holly has been severed,

04:56.000 --> 04:58.620
and the transfer of power 
cannot be performed.

05:00.040 --> 05:02.300
The royal authority is great.

05:02.300 --> 05:06.100
If it does not lie with the correct 
owner at the correct time,

05:06.100 --> 05:08.620
it will only foster the spread of evil.

05:08.620 --> 05:14.040
It may be only a short time before 
this forest suffers a fatal collapse.

05:14.420 --> 05:16.380
Then, give it to me.

05:16.380 --> 05:17.410
Menel?!

05:17.910 --> 05:22.230
Lord of Oak, entrust your 
royal authority to me.

05:23.610 --> 05:25.460
I cannot.

05:25.460 --> 05:29.200
It may have been possible for 
the true fae from days of old,

05:29.200 --> 05:33.260
but because you carry human blood in 
your veins, you would not last a month.

05:33.260 --> 05:36.550
Your soul would be destroyed.

05:36.550 --> 05:39.030
One month is no problem.

05:39.030 --> 05:41.970
He and I will resolve this 
whole matter in that time.

05:42.650 --> 05:45.560
Why would you go to such lengths?

05:46.110 --> 05:49.300
Because I swore I'd live 
my life looking forward

05:49.300 --> 05:50.840
to atone for my sins.

05:51.960 --> 05:55.010
Through a friend who saved the 
soul of the one who saved me,

05:55.500 --> 05:57.230
I made a vow to the great goddess.

05:57.670 --> 05:59.530
No greater reason than that.

06:11.710 --> 06:15.800
This trial is a secret rite 
known only to this forest.

06:16.280 --> 06:19.700
You, agent of the goddess of light,

06:20.190 --> 06:23.240
do not have the right to participate.

06:24.170 --> 06:25.810
I realize that.

06:25.810 --> 06:28.670
I'll wait here, for days if I must.

06:32.130 --> 06:36.650
I won't make you wait for days. Don't worry.

06:43.910 --> 06:46.360
<i>I don't know what happened in there,</i>

06:46.360 --> 06:52.740
<i>what hardships Menel went 
through, or what he overcame.</i>

06:53.770 --> 06:54.660
<i>But...</i>

07:11.800 --> 07:15.500
<i>That was how Menel received 
the royal authority.</i>

07:20.080 --> 07:21.490
Menel, you ready?

07:21.490 --> 07:23.700
Perfectly. You handle the rest.

07:24.550 --> 07:26.720
Lord... Lord of Holly!

07:27.070 --> 07:31.060
Twin brother who rules from the summer 
solstice to the winter solstice!

07:31.060 --> 07:35.420
I bestow upon thee the power I received 
from your lord brother, the Lord of Oak,

07:35.420 --> 07:37.080
the power that makes a king!

07:56.190 --> 07:58.200
You will regret that.

07:58.200 --> 08:01.710
To think you had already 
won over the Lord of Oak!

08:02.080 --> 08:04.870
We will defeat you. For this forest...

08:05.500 --> 08:09.460
By the light of Gracefeel, 
goddess of the cycle of death and rebirth!

08:14.430 --> 08:16.050
From smoke to flames

08:14.580 --> 08:16.640
De fumo ad fla—

08:16.300 --> 08:17.680
Be Silent, Mouth

08:16.640 --> 08:17.680
Tacere, Os!

08:20.990 --> 08:22.010
It went off anyway?

08:23.460 --> 08:25.020
Well done, well done.

08:41.220 --> 08:43.450
Are you really human?!

08:52.050 --> 08:55.200
I am the Lord of Holly.

08:55.200 --> 08:58.670
For your bravery and valor in 
eliminating those insolent invaders,

08:58.670 --> 09:02.380
and for performing the transfer 
of the royal authority,

09:02.380 --> 09:05.340
I commend you and thank you 
from the bottom of my heart.

09:05.690 --> 09:09.600
I must first restore order 
to this maddened forest.

09:25.860 --> 09:30.040
He uses that insane power like 
it's just another hand or foot.

09:30.350 --> 09:32.640
Child of both elf and man,

09:32.640 --> 09:35.290
you will be like me one day.

09:36.230 --> 09:37.020
Huh?

09:37.590 --> 09:42.550
You forged a contract with 
my brother, the Lord of Oak.

09:42.870 --> 09:47.620
Though only briefly, you held within 
yourself the authority to rule the forest.

09:47.620 --> 09:52.120
The human and fae blood and power within 
you is already inclining toward fae,

09:52.120 --> 09:57.190
bringing you closer to being a suitable 
vessel for a Lord of the Forest.

09:57.190 --> 09:58.150
Huh?

09:58.570 --> 10:01.200
I had no intention of doing any of that.

10:01.860 --> 10:05.420
That is what it means to entrust 
the royal authority to another,

10:05.420 --> 10:07.580
young sprout.

10:09.290 --> 10:10.800
Worry not.

10:11.590 --> 10:14.530
This does not mean you will 
transform right away.

10:14.530 --> 10:16.580
So long as you do not neglect your training,

10:16.580 --> 10:20.060
then perhaps after well 
over a hundred years,

10:20.060 --> 10:22.970
you will become a new Lord of the Forest.

10:23.590 --> 10:25.000
Can I refuse?

10:25.000 --> 10:26.890
It is not impossible.

10:26.890 --> 10:29.920
If you wish it, you may still 
die as a child of man.

10:30.610 --> 10:32.430
Give it plenty of thought.

10:32.950 --> 10:36.830
And you, child of man, disciple of light...

10:36.830 --> 10:37.850
Yes?

10:37.850 --> 10:40.790
There is something I must tell you.

10:41.790 --> 10:47.120
Do you know of the mountain range to 
the west whose rocks have turned red?

10:47.120 --> 10:50.100
You mean the Rust Mountains?

10:51.270 --> 10:54.940
In a future that is not so distant 
for you children of man,

10:54.940 --> 10:59.390
the Fire of Black Calamity will break out.

10:59.390 --> 11:04.890
The flames will spread, and may even 
consume this land in its entirety.

11:05.500 --> 11:06.900
You mean...

11:06.900 --> 11:11.590
Those demon beasts came here from 
the Rust Mountains, as well.

11:11.590 --> 11:14.930
That land is now a nest of demons.

11:14.930 --> 11:19.080
A land where the enormous 
Lord of Hellfire and Miasma sleeps,

11:19.080 --> 11:21.900
making his bed from the riches 
of the mountain people.

11:22.180 --> 11:24.670
Lord of Hellfire and Miasma?

11:25.350 --> 11:29.710
Whether you choose to fight 
it or accept it, be prepared.

11:29.710 --> 11:31.840
That day is not far off now.

11:31.840 --> 11:34.440
This is both a warning and an act of duty.

11:35.540 --> 11:39.050
Child of man, young sprout,

11:39.660 --> 11:43.590
I promise you a bountiful 
harvest this autumn.

11:44.780 --> 11:46.990
<i>The Fire of Black Calamity...</i>

11:49.430 --> 11:52.210
I truly asked too much of you this time.

11:52.210 --> 11:54.800
Or perhaps I should say "again"?

11:55.480 --> 11:59.530
I'll say. You put us to work every 
damn time something happens.

11:59.530 --> 12:03.910
Well, the paladin here is a 
retainer of mine, after all.

12:03.910 --> 12:07.900
And if I send for Sir William, I get 
a fine hero like you along with him.

12:07.900 --> 12:09.550
A real bargain!

12:09.550 --> 12:11.660
I'm not some bonus from a market stall!

12:12.040 --> 12:15.110
But you are the paladin's friend.

12:15.110 --> 12:17.700
Just as a friend fights for his friend,

12:17.700 --> 12:20.700
a knight fights for the people 
and for his lord.

12:21.380 --> 12:22.660
Am I wrong?

12:22.660 --> 12:25.410
Service, devotion, loyalty...

12:25.410 --> 12:29.100
It all sounds nice on the surface, 
but what's the reality?

12:29.100 --> 12:32.110
If you burden someone too 
much, you breed discontent.

12:32.110 --> 12:35.310
So what if, the next time you really 
need them, they don't want to help?

12:35.580 --> 12:39.500
That's true. I wouldn't want the 
paladin to run away from me.

12:39.500 --> 12:43.970
So I must make sure to compensate 
him generously so he sticks around.

12:43.970 --> 12:48.290
Exactly. It's important to 
have that kind of attitude.

12:48.290 --> 12:51.790
That makes him feel good about 
demonstrating his loyalty.

12:51.790 --> 12:55.080
I'll give you money and whatever 
goods you want later.

12:55.080 --> 12:56.870
Leave it to Menel.

12:56.870 --> 12:59.040
That aside, Sir William...

12:59.040 --> 13:01.660
Y-Yes? What is it?

13:01.940 --> 13:04.240
I have a big favor to ask of you.

13:04.240 --> 13:07.940
Would you give Meneldor here to me?

13:07.940 --> 13:08.550
Huh?

13:08.550 --> 13:12.550
He's a talented fairy user as 
well as a masterful hunter.

13:12.550 --> 13:17.190
Plus he's a half-elf who doesn't age, 
and he doesn't hesitate to tell me off.

13:17.190 --> 13:20.800
Yes, I want him. I truly want him.

13:20.800 --> 13:24.410
Your Highness, Menel isn't property.

13:26.890 --> 13:29.650
I apologize for the wait, Your Highness.

13:29.650 --> 13:31.710
Thanks for coming, Bagley.

13:31.710 --> 13:34.590
It's good to see you again, Bishop Bagley.

13:34.910 --> 13:38.070
Hah. Victorious again, I suppose?

13:38.070 --> 13:41.590
My word, hero... After all the flattery 
for your peerless acts of valor,

13:41.590 --> 13:45.660
I thought perhaps you'd have gotten 
cocky and lost at least once by now.

13:46.230 --> 13:50.040
Now, why don't you give us 
your report on this incident?

13:50.950 --> 13:55.460
"The Fire of Black Calamity will 
break out in the Rust Mountains.

13:55.460 --> 13:59.890
The flames will spread, and may even 
consume this land in its entirety."

14:00.420 --> 14:03.350
That's what the Lord of Holly told me.

14:03.680 --> 14:07.240
I thought the matter of the demon 
beasts and demons had settled down...

14:07.240 --> 14:09.620
Now we have an unknown 
"Fire of Black Calamity"

14:09.620 --> 14:11.830
and "Lord of Hellfire and Miasma"?

14:11.830 --> 14:13.370
I'm also concerned about

14:13.370 --> 14:18.410
the story you once told me about the demons' 
High King sealed in the City of the Dead.

14:18.990 --> 14:22.170
It's just one disturbance 
after another, isn't it?

14:22.170 --> 14:25.370
Honestly... Never a dull 
moment on this continent.

14:25.810 --> 14:31.250
Hunter, what sort of power does 
this Lord of the Forest have?

14:31.250 --> 14:34.520
Can this prophecy of his be trusted?

14:34.520 --> 14:36.740
Call me by my name, old man.

14:36.740 --> 14:38.830
Are you in any position to talk?!

14:39.410 --> 14:42.030
Um, could you two please get along?

14:42.030 --> 14:45.570
With this insolent brat? 
Spare me your jokes!

14:45.570 --> 14:48.900
I hate pompous oafs like him.

14:49.240 --> 14:52.950
But he makes a fine business 
partner, doesn't he?

14:54.220 --> 14:57.320
Well, I do admit that he is talented.

14:58.060 --> 15:00.840
I wouldn't be sitting at the 
same table with you otherwise.

15:06.440 --> 15:07.710
Look here.

15:07.710 --> 15:11.970
The Lords of the Forest rule the entire 
region adjacent to this ley line.

15:11.970 --> 15:15.440
It can be a spirit dwelling 
within a great tree or rock,

15:15.440 --> 15:18.810
an aged beast that's acquired intelligence, 
or one of many other forms,

15:18.810 --> 15:22.060
but they've all lived for 
at least a century or two.

15:22.960 --> 15:26.360
They're known as the 
forest's heart and brain,

15:26.360 --> 15:29.240
and they know everything that 
happens in their domain.

15:29.240 --> 15:31.390
If a prophecy comes from 
a Lord of the Forest,

15:31.390 --> 15:33.320
there's probably solid 
grounds to back it up.

15:33.320 --> 15:35.700
You can consider it a forecast.

15:37.920 --> 15:41.830
This seems like a matter we should 
treat as a high priority.

15:41.830 --> 15:42.770
Yes.

15:43.190 --> 15:47.010
The Rust Mountains, 
the ruined dwarf capital,

15:47.010 --> 15:49.210
is a nest of demons now, eh?

15:49.990 --> 15:52.020
That sounds great!

15:52.020 --> 15:54.720
In other words, we can go 
as crazy as we want, right?

15:56.470 --> 15:58.870
We know where the problem is located.

15:58.870 --> 16:01.900
A desolate, hostile land where there's 
no fear of harming bystanders!

16:01.900 --> 16:04.730
In other words, this is a case meant for me!

16:06.980 --> 16:09.600
Yes, I suppose you're right.

16:10.630 --> 16:13.740
Would you take care of this matter, paladin?

16:14.490 --> 16:15.750
Of course.

16:16.030 --> 16:17.720
Good grief...

16:17.720 --> 16:21.350
If a Lord of the Forest 
promised a bountiful harvest,

16:21.350 --> 16:24.360
we can probably assume we're 
safe until autumn, at least.

16:24.360 --> 16:26.480
The first step is to gather information.

16:26.480 --> 16:31.530
I'll talk to my troubadour friend and 
the dwarfs living in Torch Port.

16:32.010 --> 16:34.090
Can I entrust all of this to you?

16:34.090 --> 16:34.730
Yes.

16:35.050 --> 16:40.260
This matter will remain a secret 
between the four of us for now.

16:40.260 --> 16:43.330
Not a problem. I'm sure it'll all work out.

16:43.330 --> 16:46.530
When you say that, it makes 
me feel like it really will.

16:46.530 --> 16:51.140
Hmph! Don't get cocky after all this 
hero treatment and let your guard down!

16:54.700 --> 16:56.910
About the Rust Mountains?

16:56.910 --> 17:00.160
Yeah. I want to learn all I can about them.

17:01.360 --> 17:04.460
A troubadour's song doesn't 
come free, you know.

17:04.460 --> 17:05.790
What'll you pay for my information?

17:05.790 --> 17:07.100
U-Uh...

17:07.100 --> 17:09.570
If we end up having to go 
to the Rust Mountains,

17:09.570 --> 17:11.870
we'll tell you any stories 
we pick up there first.

17:11.870 --> 17:13.060
Is that good enough?

17:13.420 --> 17:15.920
Okay! It's a deal!

17:17.440 --> 17:19.930
Two hundred years ago, the Rust Mountains

17:19.930 --> 17:23.090
were known as the Iron Mountains.

17:23.090 --> 17:26.040
It was home to the Iron 
Country, where the dwarfs,

17:26.040 --> 17:31.530
mountainfolk who followed the god of 
fire and technology, Blaze, lived.

17:31.940 --> 17:35.820
It was a powerful country that 
was once included in the Union.

17:36.430 --> 17:38.070
The Iron Country...

17:38.330 --> 17:42.360
But it was lost in the great 
uprising two hundred years ago.

17:42.360 --> 17:45.190
To stop the advance of the demons,

17:45.190 --> 17:47.700
the dwarf monarch of the mansion on the rock

17:47.700 --> 17:50.510
led many powerful warriors to fight them,

17:50.510 --> 17:52.870
but they all died in battle on the mountain.

17:52.870 --> 17:56.320
Much blood was shed, many 
weapons were dispersed,

17:56.320 --> 17:58.600
and the mountain became the demons' nest.

17:58.600 --> 18:03.060
Then, at some point, the area became 
known as the Rust Mountains.

18:03.060 --> 18:05.580
Because that's what happens when iron dies?

18:05.580 --> 18:10.150
The details of what happened in that 
battle didn't survive, even in song.

18:10.150 --> 18:12.330
There's really no information 
about it at all.

18:12.330 --> 18:13.230
Why?

18:13.230 --> 18:17.230
Because all the dwarf warriors 
and citizens were wiped out.

18:17.230 --> 18:18.620
And...

18:19.020 --> 18:22.130
The fate of any dwarf who fled the country

18:22.130 --> 18:24.490
was just too cruel to speak of.

18:25.600 --> 18:27.000
Half a year ago,

18:27.400 --> 18:31.040
we took in some dwarf 
refugees at Torch Port.

18:31.730 --> 18:33.160
I'll never forget it.

18:33.160 --> 18:35.850
All of their eyes looked utterly exhausted.

18:36.260 --> 18:38.840
It made me realize that if we'd 
taken one wrong step somewhere,

18:38.840 --> 18:41.070
that could've been us.

18:41.400 --> 18:42.810
Menel...

18:42.810 --> 18:47.200
Everyone knows what befalls people who 
are driven out of their homeland.

18:47.200 --> 18:51.390
That's why none of them want to 
talk about their home mountain,

18:51.390 --> 18:53.130
or what happened in that final battle.

18:53.130 --> 18:54.890
So that's why...

18:55.310 --> 18:59.360
So that's all I can tell you. I'm sorry.

18:59.360 --> 19:02.100
No, you were a big help.

19:02.100 --> 19:03.720
But you know, Will...

19:03.720 --> 19:08.190
If you were to talk to them with 
the understanding you have now,

19:08.190 --> 19:11.140
they just might talk to you, if no one else.

19:12.030 --> 19:14.280
All right. Thanks.

19:19.990 --> 19:21.120
This way.

19:26.430 --> 19:28.300
The fairies' path...

19:28.880 --> 19:30.260
Is this the right way?

19:30.260 --> 19:33.900
Yeah, I can tell. I mean, I can tell <i>now</i>.

19:33.900 --> 19:35.270
Because of the royal authority?

19:35.270 --> 19:37.910
Apparently. Not that I asked for it.

19:38.200 --> 19:42.160
You know, if you and I get 
separated, I'm done for.

19:42.420 --> 19:45.120
Don't worry. I won't lose you.

19:45.120 --> 19:46.910
If you stray away, I'll drag you back.

19:46.910 --> 19:49.040
You can do that, too?

19:49.040 --> 19:51.660
I was planning to train myself to do this...

19:51.660 --> 19:55.630
But hey, whether you get it free 
or work for it, power is power.

19:55.630 --> 19:57.920
It's all the same once you 
make it a part of yourself.

19:59.740 --> 20:03.940
It's amazing, though. You're going 
to be a Lord of the Forest someday?

20:04.220 --> 20:08.110
In two or three hundred years, if not more.

20:08.660 --> 20:10.940
It's probably somewhere in that realm.

20:12.480 --> 20:14.810
I'll be long dead by then.

20:15.310 --> 20:16.430
True.

20:16.740 --> 20:19.310
Maybe I'll be your gravekeeper

20:19.310 --> 20:22.890
while I watch where your kids 
and grandkids end up...

20:22.890 --> 20:26.200
I guess everything will 
have settled down by then.

20:26.530 --> 20:28.850
You've been planning to do that?

20:28.850 --> 20:30.780
Yes, I have.

20:30.780 --> 20:33.840
I have all kinds of debts to 
you that I can never repay.

20:35.330 --> 20:40.080
All half-elves have to make a 
life-altering decision at some point.

20:40.680 --> 20:45.330
To live as an elf, almost like the fae
for perpetuity alongside the earth and water...

20:45.720 --> 20:50.910
Or to live the human life, like a 
flickering fire or a gust of wind.

20:51.370 --> 20:54.350
That's the fate of those 
born with both bloodlines.

20:58.200 --> 21:01.870
I want to see what becomes 
of all your accomplishments.

21:03.060 --> 21:06.100
I might not be able to 
do anything that great.

21:06.470 --> 21:09.060
You're already enough of a legend.

21:09.710 --> 21:14.610
And you'll keep making more legends, 
all with that spacey face of yours.

21:14.610 --> 21:19.310
I'll be fighting by your side, 
and if I survive until your life ends...

21:19.310 --> 21:23.750
Yeah... It might not be so bad to wrap it 
all up by fading away into the forest.

21:24.440 --> 21:29.250
After I say some awesome line to make 
myself look good in the end, of course.

21:30.380 --> 21:32.020
You'll be a legend.

21:32.020 --> 21:35.130
As will you. Doesn't sound bad, right?

21:35.130 --> 21:35.870
Yeah.

21:43.800 --> 21:47.360
Amazing... That distance should've 
taken days to cover...

21:47.360 --> 21:48.960
Pretty handy, aren't they?

21:48.960 --> 21:51.800
It's a little scary that you 
use them so easily, though...

21:58.360 --> 22:02.650
We've made it back to our Torch Port home.

23:35.850 --> 23:39.970
The Last King
